arch letter
name Municipal Order of Darcap pt. 2/2
msg
V. Artificer Discipline Status

The Artificer skill is not banned.

However, its instruction is suspended pending review. Recipes exceeding the Third Layer of Complexity are to be sealed. Experimental synthesis involving recursive enchantment, self-modifying matrices, or cross-category binding (notably jewelry-to-weapon or armor-to-memory interfaces) is forbidden until further notice.

Valleynoy was not reckless. It was thorough. That is what makes this necessary.

VI. Final Declaration

The people of Valleynoy are declared dead, though no bodies were recovered. Their work is declared incomplete, though much of it endures. Their city is declared gone, though its consequences remain.

Darcap acknowledges its role in Valleynoy's creation and accepts responsibility for its erasure; not as penance, but as containment.

Let this order stand as both memorial and boundary.

Some knowledge advances civilization.
Some knowledge advances only itself.

By the will of the Guilds,
and under seal,

Master Auditor Kesh Valmor
Guild of the Smoking Cauldron

Silent Warden Rhael
Guild of the Poisoned Dagger

Order sealed. Copies restricted. Further inquiry discouraged.
endmsg
